{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣藝人楊丞琳對毛小孩也充滿關愛，過去她曾與愛犬Yumi感情深厚，雙方陪伴彼此將近17年。</p><p>可惜，自Yumi離世後，她沒有再養狗隻。</p><p>直到如今已快五年。</p><p>楊丞琳無預警下迎來新成員，透過社交平台分追了抱着新狗狗的照片。</p><p>見她臉上洋溢着幸福的笑容。</p><p>楊丞</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.925223+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_hash":"689311473cdf563b44369c940b55077caf91f703cd536ac14af352c465424ba6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}